# Herminox — daily plan & hard rules

## Security 10/10 (never violate)
- No Telegram/Discord scraping, cold DMs, NLP from private chats
- No Reddit/forum spam bots
- No thin 10k PSEO; no Seller Central phishing; no storing calculator inputs on servers
- Prefill query URLs are for humans only (`noindex`); index only clean unique URLs

## Safe growth stack (do these)
1. Prefill deep-links (done for FBA + ACoS; extend others)
2. Embed widgets + manual coach/blogger outreach
3. **While GSC pilot is not green:** deepen existing guides, ship Lab Notes, outreach — **do not** mass-add LF guides
4. After green pilot: 3–5 unique guide pages/day max (formula + table + example), only if uniqueness audit passes + allowlist
5. GSC: sitemap index (`/sitemap.xml`), indexing, Core Web Vitals
6. Public read-only Calc API — later
7. Manual helpful Reddit/forum answers — no bots

## Daily checklist (pilot phase)
- [ ] Strengthen OR Lab Note OR partner emails — not thin new URL volume
- [ ] 5–10 partner outreach emails (templates: https://herminox.com/partners/)
- [ ] Spot-check GA4 Realtime + Cloudflare analytics after deploy
- [ ] GSC: inspect priority URLs; watch coverage / “Page with redirect”
- [ ] One calculator smoke-test (FBA → ACoS → Inventory rotation)
- [ ] After guide/math changes: `node scripts/audit-guide-uniqueness.mjs` + `node scripts/audit-calculators.mjs`

## Calculator audit notes
- Recovery inventory uses **sell − fees** (cash back), not profit
- Cost Per Use demo: Quality $220+$40 / 5y vs Cheap $60 / 1y (old $300/$60 was a tie)
- Re-run audit after any math change: `node scripts/audit-calculators.mjs`

## Weekly
- [ ] Review embed UTM sources for partner clicks
- [ ] Fix any calculator logic bugs found in audit
- [ ] 1 manual high-quality community answer (human, not bot)
- [ ] Review allowlist vs matrix candidates — promote only unique logic

## Uniqueness rule
One clean URL = one unique page. Every guide needs distinct substance. See `herminox-pseo-law.mdc`.
